WEBVTT

00:30.688 --> 00:34.973
The city lights are fading in the glass Watching

00:35.033 --> 00:38.958
the broken billboards flying past Ten years of

00:39.018 --> 00:43.123
playing out a scripted scene Caught in the teeth

00:43.183 --> 00:48.298
of the machine I drop the window, let the cold air

00:48.518 --> 00:52.398
in Shedding the ghost of who I've always been

00:52.799 --> 00:56.259
There's a million voices trying to pull me back

00:56.639 --> 01:00.720
But the tires are humming on the open track Yeah,

01:00.740 --> 01:06.102
the tires are humming on the open track And it's

01:06.162 --> 01:11.265
just static On the dial, turning the knob for

01:11.325 --> 01:15.409
another mile Fading out the echoes of the things

01:15.449 --> 01:20.875
they said Cutting the wire inside my head Out

01:20.955 --> 01:26.260
here on the highway, running wild Leaving the

01:26.280 --> 01:28.843
static on the dial

01:31.503 --> 01:34.467
They try to tell us what the frequency should be

01:35.328 --> 01:39.793
Sailing a plastic kind of fantasy But out in the

01:39.873 --> 01:44.419
desert where the signal dies You finally see the

01:44.639 --> 01:48.884
open skies Heaven is holding down the rhythm

01:48.944 --> 01:54.092
line Tyler is keeping us right on time There's a

01:54.412 --> 01:57.916
million voices trying to pull me back But the

01:58.216 --> 02:01.719
tires are humming on the open track Yeah, the

02:01.780 --> 02:07.319
tires are humming on the open track And it's just

02:07.339 --> 02:12.643
static on the dial Turning the knob for another

02:12.723 --> 02:16.506
mile Fading out the echoes of the things they

02:16.767 --> 02:22.471
said Cutting the wire inside my head Out here on

02:22.512 --> 02:27.956
the highway, running wild Leaving the static on

02:27.976 --> 02:29.758
the dial

02:45.121 --> 02:52.768
Tune it out, let the frequency fade

02:55.531 --> 03:00.116
Tune it out, leave the mess that they made

03:03.637 --> 03:08.078
Cause it's just static on the dial Turning the

03:08.138 --> 03:12.900
knob for another mile Fading out the echoes of

03:12.920 --> 03:17.942
the things they said Cutting the wire inside my

03:17.962 --> 03:22.043
head Out here on the highway, running wild

03:23.583 --> 03:28.885
Leaving the static on the dial Just static

03:30.245 --> 03:31.526
fading away

03:35.022 --> 03:39.327
Nothing but the open road today

